      "snippet": "Authentic JB dining experience. Simply didn't want to eat in Aeon mall so searched up online and landed on this place.\n\nWent at 6pm and wasn't crowded at all. Had a sambal Kang kong, bittergourd soup with fish, fried pork (must eat!!), 2 bowls of rice, and 2 drinks. Total bill was 40 ringgit - and our most expensive meal of the day already 🤣\n\nPork was nicely fried, and bittergourd soup wasn't too bitter - still much digestable despite me not liking bitter gourd. Go for it if you like some really value for money zi char.\n\nYoung waiter was very smiley (:",
